    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pookie's Lingerie Shop\u00a0</strong>is a short and simple flirty lingerie shop dating sim with light management elements. As a corporate-assigned manager, you\u2019ll work with the sharp-tongued Pookie, handle quirky customers, and meet the mysterious collection officer Regina. Your choices shape relationships and lead to multiple romantic paths. Will you boost sales and find love\u2014or cause chaos in the shop?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Visual Novel + Dating Sim + Light Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting:</strong>\u00a0lingerie shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Role:</strong> You\u2019re sent by the corporation to help boost sales at a struggling store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Loop:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve customers and grow the shop\u2019s reputation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make key dialogue choices that influence relationships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage shop performance to unlock story events</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romance Paths:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build trust with characters through work, events, and dates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two main romance routes, each with their own tone and twists</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
